{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/39824-the-i-can-t-sleep-thread","id":39824,"title":"The I can't Sleep Thread!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-30T23:20:14-08:00","id":39824,"title":"The I can't Sleep Thread!","content":"Grrr so I passed out for a couple hours and missed cooking dinner, but I didn't get to sleep in 2 days, and I finally got the medicine I reaaaally needed! So I wake up to see if I should cook and its too late, so my brother cooks a pizza, I go to sleep but I am awakened to help eat the pizza, being not very hungry and still getting used to eating more then one meal in a day I could only eat one slice, and now... I can't sleep even though I probably reaaally need to ... I was finally going to get my sleep schedule fixed with this too... sigh...<br /> <br /> <br /> Okay now your turn...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T00:56:04-08:00","id":39846,"title":"","content":"Woke up in pain, took 2 tramadol and just sitting around, waiting for it to kick in. Also got the munchies...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T09:38:32-08:00","id":40032,"title":"","content":"I work nights, and where I live is right next to a busy street. Sometimes it's just too loud and I can't sleep for a couple of days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-31T10:34:19-08:00","id":40053,"title":"","content":"I have a lot of very nasty thoughts that chase each other around and around in my mind, so I have to either physically exhaust myself or talk to someone until I've vented enough to calm down. Add to that nasty physical issues like having to sleep almost sitting up so I don't choke [thanks, sinuses]... yeah, I haven't been getting enough sleep and all I want <i>to</i> do is sleep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T04:52:01-08:00","id":51547,"title":"","content":"Can't sleep. I don't need to say why. I've been whining eno